Package: OmicChainPipeline
Type: Project
Title: OmicChain DESeq2 analysis pipeline dependencies
Description: Not a real R package to install -- this file exists only so
    that renv can track the exact packages this pipeline depends on (see
    run_deseq2.R), including packages loaded dynamically in a loop
    (require(pkg, character.only = TRUE)), which renv's automatic
    dependency scanner cannot detect on its own. Used with
    renv::snapshot(type = "explicit"). Rsubread aligns and counts the
    FASTQ files (step "Data & reference"): it is part of the certified
    R environment too.
Imports:
    DESeq2,
    tibble,
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    pheatmap,
    RColorBrewer,
    clusterProfiler,
    org.Hs.eg.db,
    AnnotationDbi,
    gridExtra,
    tiff,
    BiocManager,
    Biobase,
    apeglm,
    ggrepel,
    Rsubread
